# TestMu AI (Formerly LambdaTest): Power Your Software Testing with AI and Cloud

> TestMu AI (Formerly LambdaTest) is a Full Stack Agentic AI Quality Engineering platform that empowers teams to test intelligently and ship faster. It is also a Vibe Testing platform for the Vibe coding era. Engineered for scale, it offers end-to-end AI agents to plan, author, execute, and analyze software quality autonomously. AI-native by design, the platform enables testing of web, mobile, and enterprise applications at any scale across real devices, real browsers, and custom real-world environments.

Full documentation and a complete page index for LLMs: https://www.testmuai.com/llms-full.txt

