## About TestMu AI

TestMu AI offers intelligent AI Agents for autonomously planning, authoring, executing and analyzing software quality. Users can plan and author end to end automation tests using context like Jira ticket, natural language prompts, requirement documents, development specs, code repositories, readme files, agent.md files, pull requests, code diff, voice note, video, and much more.

Along with that the platform offers agentic ready cloud for live and automated cross-browser testing, live and automated real devices testing, AI-native visual regression testing, AI-native Integrated Test Intelligence, and OTT app testing, ensuring test coverage across any type of digital interface.

Our continuous testing cloud comes with innovative features like smart workflows, auto-test grouping, auto-retry, and fail-fast techniques that will do the heavy lifting, allowing testers/developers to concentrate on test creation rather than test execution and orchestration.

Enterprises can decide their deployment mode, be it public cloud, dedicated cloud, or on-premise. They also get access to centralized test analytics and observability that unifies all test execution data and enables informed decision-making.

The digital experience testing cloud will seamlessly fit into the CI/CD pipeline with 120+ integrations across categories like communication, bug tracking, test management, test authoring, and automation.

Trusted by over 18,000 enterprise customers and over 3 million users across 132 countries, TestMu AI (Formerly LambdaTest) is SOC 2 Type II, ISO 27001, ISO 27017, and ISO 27701 standard certified, and GDPR, CCPA, and HIPAA-ready compliant.

Key terms: Cross Browser Testing, Real Device Cloud, Mobile App Testing, Selenium Grid, Cypress Testing, Playwright Testing, Appium Testing, AI Testing, Accessibility Testing, Visual Regression Testing, Performance Testing, Test Orchestration, Test Intelligence, Test Automation

